      "side": 1,
      "message": "This selects TSO for every `VNET_BUFFER_F_GSO` packet, but VPP also uses that flag for UDP GSO and advertises UDP GSO through a separate capability. For example, vhost can produce a GSO buffer with `VNET_BUFFER_OFFLOAD_F_UDP_CKSUM`. Could we require TCP checksum offload here and ensure non-TCP GSO is segmented or dropped rather than submitted through the TCP TSO path?",
      "revId": "5f1c4ef1d470eab138072aea5d26bb6714ec31c8",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
